        <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns the last error that has been produced by any of the runtime calls in the same host thread. Note that this call does not reset the error to ::cudaSuccess like <ref refid="group__CUDART__ERROR_1ga63b4ef56febc6ec907b3d7ae1708f201" kindref="member">cudaGetLastError()</ref>.</para>
